            "scene_context": "The path narrows. Towering bioluminescent mushrooms, a spectrum of turquoise and amethyst, press close on either side, their pulsing light reflecting in puddles of shimmering liquid on the forest floor. A thick, fungal veil hangs low, damp and fragrant. Directly ahead, the path seems to *bend*, as if the forest itself is guiding you onwards. The pulsing glow intensifies, revealing, momentarily, a skeletal hand, partially buried in the fungal matter, before vanishing again. The scent of decay is stronger here, subtly overlaid with the strangely sweet aroma of the Lumiflora.",
